      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m just not sold yet on having all this code around to be \u0027opportunistic\u0027 in the rare case an AC loss happens in the middle of a JSON file being written and make a new use for the cereal files which are only still around so that if someone flashes on pre-JSON code there are still error logs.\n\nAlready the code can handle corrupt JSON files by throwing them away.",
